<#-- The regret notice to a supplier whose quote was not awarded (mantle.order.SourcingServices.close#QuoteRequest,
     R-PUR-35): the message the buyer reviewed, then the RFQ and the supplier's own quote reference. It names no other
     supplier, price or award. -->
<div style="font:11pt Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif">
<#list String(message).split('\n') as messageLine>${messageLine}<br></#list>
<p style="color:#59606b;margin-top:16px">${ec.l10n.localize('Request for quotation')} ${requestId}<#if requestName> · ${requestName}</#if><#if reference> · ${ec.l10n.localize('your reference')} ${reference}</#if></p>
</div>
